OL,3,GNEWSAForce sees rise in domestic abuse
OL,4,Ahistory requests
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore people are applying to find out
OL,7,Fabout their partner's potential
OL,8,Fprevious abusive or violent offending,
OL,9,Fa police force has said.
OL,11,FClare's Law, also known as the domestic
OL,12,Fviolence disclosure scheme, gives
OL,13,Fpeople the right to ask police to
OL,14,Frelease information about any previous
OL,15,Fhistory of violence or abuse.
OL,17,FFigures from Cleveland Police showed
OL,18,Fincrease of almost 15% in year-on-year
OL,19,Frequests for information.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
