OL,3,GNEWSAForce sees rise in domestic abuse
OL,4,Ahistory requests
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Colin Helyer said the figures
OL,7,Fwere "encouraging" and suggested more
OL,8,Fpeople were becoming aware of Clare's
OL,9,FLaw and how it could be used.
